# PLAY/STOP in SEQ mode and in HOME, with knob turns in SEQ mode on two
# sound pages (logged for the replay as --param-at), ending in the Track view
# with the playhead running and the last knob's name on the hint line.
--button 0.10:SEQ
--button 0.20:PLAY/STOP
--turn 0.55:KNOB2:8
--turn 0.90:SELECT:1
--turn 1.00:KNOB1:-10
--button 1.40:PLAY/STOP
--button 1.50:HOME
--button 1.60:PLAY/STOP:0.1
--button 1.90:SEQ
